# KitWidget - the host the system kit's parts (Messaging, Chatbot, BarChart, Checklist, Plans, CardField, MemberList,
# PermissionMatrix, StampCard, Bell, Queue, PasswordField) render through. Call those parts, not this.
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom (kit core) · host JS is kit-widget.js.
part KitWidget(name: text) { Custom KitWidget inputs(name: $name) class("cx-kit-widget") }
